1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch8","children":["FOSA丨08丨组件思维"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨08丨组件思维"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第八章的课后思考题，深入探讨软件组件的核心概念与实现方式、技术导向与领域导向分区策略的差异、实体陷阱问题的本质及解决方案，以及Actor/Actions模式、工作流分析和事件风暴等组件识别技术的适用场景与局限性，帮助理解如何运用领域驱动的思维方式来设计组件边界，提升系统的内聚性、松耦合特性和业务适应能力。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-09T10:20:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/09"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","3,954"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第八章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":["We define the term ",["$","em","em-0",{"children":"component"}]," as a building block of an application—something the application does. A component usually consist of a group of classes or source files. How are components typically manifested within an application or service?"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"组件在应用程序或服务中通常如何体现？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the difference between technical partitioning and domain partitioning? Provide an example of each."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"技术分区和领域分区有什么区别？请各举一个例子。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the advantage of domain partitioning?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"领域分区的优点是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Under what circumstances would technical partitioning be a better choice over domain partitioning?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在什么情况下，技术分区会是比领域分区更好的选择？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the entity trap? Why is it not a good approach for component identification?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"\"实体陷阱\"是什么？为什么它不是一种好的组件识别方法？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"When might you choose the workflow approach over the Actor/Actions approach when identifying core components?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在识别核心组件时，你何时会选择 workflow 方法而不是 actor/actions 方法？"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"组件范围","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#组件范围","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#组件范围"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"组件范围","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":4,"offset":1084},"end":{"line":31,"column":8,"offset":1088}}}]},"children":"组件范围"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250709102652672.png","alt":"FOSA Figure 8-1. Different varieties of components","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250709102652672.png","alt":"FOSA Figure 8-1. Different varieties of components"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1,"offset":1090},"end":{"line":33,"column":134,"offset":1223}}}}]}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47"]}]}],"$L48","$L49","$L4a"]}],"$L4b"]}]]}]}]
