34:["$","ol","ol-2",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"识别执行者 (Identify Actors):"}]," 列出所有会与系统交互的\"人\"或\"外部系统\"。例如：顾客 (Customer)、管理员 (Admin)、仓库管理系统 (WMS)、支付网关 (Payment Gateway)。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"识别操作 (Identify Actions):"}]," 针对每一个执行者，列出他们会对系统发起的具体操作（可以理解为用例）。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"顾客"}]," 可以：搜索商品、查看商品详情、添加购物车、提交订单、支付。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"管理员"}]," 可以：上架商品、调整价格、查看销售报表。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"组件划分："}]," 将相关的操作进行分组，形成初步的组件。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"搜索商品"}],"、",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"查看商品详情"}]," -> 可能属于 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Catalog"}]," (商品目录) 组件。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"添加购物车"}],"、",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"提交订单"}]," -> 可能属于 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Ordering"}]," (订单) 组件。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"上架商品"}],"、",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"调整价格"}]," -> 可能属于 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"ProductManagement"}]," (商品管理) 组件。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}]
