3a:["$","p","p-29",{"children":["事件风暴是领域驱动设计 (DDD) 中一种强大的 ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"协作式工作坊技术"}],"，用于快速、全面地探索复杂的业务领域，并从中识别出聚合 (Aggregates) 和限界上下文 (Bounded Contexts)，而这些正是划分高质量组件（尤其是微服务）的理想边界。"]}]
3b:["$","p","p-30",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"核心过程:"}]," 这是一个由业务专家和技术专家共同参与的会议，大家在一个足够大的墙上，用不同颜色的即时贴 (sticky notes) 来“风暴”出整个业务流程。"]}]
3c:["$","ol","ol-3",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"橙色贴 - 领域事件 (Domain Event):"}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"规则："}]," 用过去时态描述业务中发生过的、有价值的事情。这是整个风暴的核心。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"例子："}]," ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"订单已提交"}],"、",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"商品已添加到购物车"}],"、",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"用户已注册"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":"大家将所有能想到的事件，按照时间顺序从左到右贴在墙上。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"蓝色贴 - 命令 (Command):"}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"规则："}]," 触发领域事件的用户操作或系统指令。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"例子："}]," ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"提交订单"}]," (触发 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"订单已提交"}],")、",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"添加商品到购物车"}]," (触发 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"商品已添加到购物车"}],")。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"黄色小贴 - 执行者 (Actor):"}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"规则："}]," 发出命令的人或系统。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"例子："}]," ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"顾客"}]," (发出 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"提交订单"}]," 命令)。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"粉色/黄色大贴 - 聚合 (Aggregate):"}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"规则："}]," 聚合是处理命令并产生事件的业务实体，它负责维护一组相关对象的数据一致性。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"例子："}]," ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"订单"}]," 聚合负责处理 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"提交订单"}]," 命令，并产生 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"订单已提交"}]," 事件。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"划定边界 - 限界上下文 (Bounded Context):"}]," 当整个流程可视化之后，团队会发现某些事件、命令和聚合在业务上高度相关，形成了一个个的\"簇\"。这些\"簇\"的边界，就是",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"限界上下文"}]," 的边界，也是",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"组件/微服务"}]," 的理想边界。例如，所有与订单创建、修改、状态流转相关的即时贴会自然地聚集在一起，形成 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Ordering"}]," 上下文。"]}],"\n"]}]
